{"speciesId":230,"names":{"fr":"Hyporoi","es":"Kingdra","en":"Kingdra","ja":"キングドラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It sleeps deep on the ocean floor to build its energy. It is said to cause tornadoes as it wakes."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life forms can survive."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"KINGDRA lives at extreme ocean depths that are otherwise uninhabited. It has long been believed that the yawning of this POKéMON creates spiraling ocean currents."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"KINGDRA sleeps on the seafloor where it is otherwise devoid of life. When a storm arrives, the POKéMON is said to awaken and wander about in search of prey."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It sleeps quietly, deep on the seafloor. When it comes up to the surface, it creates a huge whirlpool that can swallow even ships."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It sleeps deep on the ocean floor to build its energy. It is said to cause tornadoes as it wakes."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It sleeps deep on the ocean floor to build its energy. It is said to cause tornadoes as it wakes."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Chacun de ses déplacements provoque des tourbillons. Il vit dans les grottes sous-marines."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Chacun de ses déplacements provoque des tourbillons. Il vit dans les grottes sous-marines."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On dit qu’il se cache dans les grottes sous-marines. Il peut créer des tourbillons en bâillant."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Dicen que suele esconderse en cuevas submarinas. Puede crear torbellinos al bostezar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"普段は 海底洞窟に 身を 潜めているらしい。 あくびで 渦潮を 発生させる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il emmagasine de l’énergie en restant dans les fonds marins, là où rien d’autre ne peut survivre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Almacena energía durmiendo en las profundidades submarinas, allá donde no llegan otros seres."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life-forms can survive."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"どんな 生き物も 降りられない 深い 海の底で 眠りながら 力を 蓄えている という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hyporoi vit au fin fond des profondeurs océaniques généralement inhabitées. On a longtemps cru que le bâillement de ce Pokémon créait les tourbillons dans les océans."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kingdra vive en lo más profundo del océano, donde no habita ninguna otra especie. Siempre se ha pensado que su bostezo causaba las corrientes en remolino que se dan en el océano."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kingdra lives at extreme ocean depths that are otherwise uninhabited. It has long been believed that the yawning of this Pokémon creates spiraling ocean currents."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"生物の すまない 深海に 生息する。 キングドラの 欠伸が 逆巻く 海流を 引き起こすと 長い 間 信じられてきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hyporoi dort au fond de l’océan, où aucune autre forme de vie ne réside. On raconte que lorsqu’une tempête survient, c’est que ce Pokémon s’éveille et erre dans les profondeurs en quête de proies."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kingdra duerme en el lecho marino, donde apenas pueden encontrarse otras formas de vida. Cuando estalla una tormenta, dicen que se despierta y se pone a vagar en busca de su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kingdra sleeps on the seafloor where it is otherwise devoid of life. When a storm arrives, the Pokémon is said to awaken and wander about in search of prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"生き物の すまない 海底で 眠っている。 台風が やってくると 目を 覚まして 獲物を 探しに うろつき回ると いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il apparaît à la surface de l’océan lorsqu’une tempête arrive. Dès qu’il croise un Dracolosse, un combat féroce s’ensuit."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se deja ver en la superficie del mar cuando hay tormentas. Si se encuentra con Dragonite, tendrá lugar una violenta pelea."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"With the arrival of a storm at sea, this Pokémon will show itself on the surface. When a Kingdra and a Dragonite meet, a fierce battle ensues."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"嵐が来ると 海面に 姿を 見せる。 カイリューに 出くわすと 激しい 争いが はじまる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les écailles qui se détachent de son corps brillent d’un éclat si élégant et si intense qu’on les offre aux familles royales."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las escamas que se le desprenden poseen una calidad tan excelsa y un resplandor tan intenso que han sido ofrecidas a la realeza como regalos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Scales shed by this Pokémon have such a splendorous gleam to them that they’ve been given to royalty as gifts."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"剥がれた ウロコは 王族へ 献上されるほど 上質で 深みのある 輝きを もつ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":230,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",15],[4,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",15],[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",15],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",15],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",15],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",8],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",8],[12,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",22],[4,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",22],[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",22],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",22],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",22],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",11],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",11],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",11],[